          "text": "30"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "32"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "marks": 1,
      "negativeMarks": 0.25,
      "explanation": "The middle number equals the average, so the numbers are 20, 22, 24, 26 and 28. The largest is 28."
